%%{init: {'theme': 'dark'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as server
    participant P as PeriodicUpdater
    participant E as SelfEvolver
    participant I as SelfImprover
    S->>P: 启动后台线程
    P->>P: 立即跑一次（消化积压）
    loop 每 24h 检查
        P->>E: weekly_insight_update
        E-->>P: 洞察+Library 防护
        P->>P: batch_update（清过期快照）
        P->>I: analyze_failures
        I-->>P: improvements.md
    end
    P-->>S: 下次教学自动加载改进
